<title>UK: Steel Castings has 67.7 pct in Wm Cook.</title>
<headline>Steel Castings has 67.7 pct in Wm Cook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly formed venture capital firm Steel Castings Investments Plc said on Wednesday that it had acquired interest in 67.7 percent of William Cook Plc.</p>
<p>Steel Castings said it had valid acceptances for its offer for around 11.9 million William Cook shares representing around 66.1 percent.</p>
<p>The firm has contracted to buy another 860,846 shares from chief executive Andrew Cook who has led the management buyout of the firm.</p>
</text>
